1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,987
Nothing consequential ships itself.

2
00:00:02,937 --> 00:00:06,175
The invoice draft waits in the approvals queue.

3
00:00:06,175 --> 00:00:13,650
Approving appends a second audit record under the same request ID — the human decision is part of the trail, not a side-channel.

4
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:16,012
Rejection works the same way.

